6: # V3 DDD Architecture
7: 
8: ## What This Skill Does
9: 
10: Designs and implements Domain-Driven Design (DDD) architecture for claude-flow v3, decomposing god objects into bounded contexts, implementing clean architecture patterns, and enabling modular, testable code structure.
11: 
